flowchart LR
  U["Sorawick Online University<br/>(fictional; the owner)"] -- "signs the campus card,<br/>sets the door policy" --> C
  A["Arrivals<br/>read the campus window:<br/>programmes, what enrolment asks"] --> C{"Campus host representative<br/>admissions and registrar<br/>checks the card"}
